  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Riksbanken</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Riksbank - Riksbanken</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Riksbankens Staff Exchange Program som bedrivs med ett mindre antal   andra centralbanker syftar till att &#xf6;verf&#xf6;ra kunskap inom viktiga     centralbanksrelaterade omr&#xe5;den. Riksbanken och Sida har en fler&#xe5;rig   relation inom utvecklingssamarbete. Detta &#xe4;r Sidas tredje avtal med   Riksbanken kring deras &quot;Staff Exchange Program&quot;. St&#xf6;det omfattar      perioden 2012-2014 och uppg&#xe5;r till MSEK 10,5 inkl en utv&#xe4;rdering.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Riksbank&#xb4;s Staff Exchange Program is carried out with a limited   number of central banks and aims at promote knowledge promotion       within important areas for central banks. Sida and the Riksbank has a long history of cooperation and this is the 3rd agreement. The        support covers the period 2012-2014 and the total budget is MSEK      10,5, including a midterm review.</narrative>
  </description>
